WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:02.250
Your brain is not a to-do

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:02.930
list.

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:03.970
Seriously.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.130
Meet Stickly.

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.970
Cute handwritten notes that stay on

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.170
your Windows desktop.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.010
Brain dump?

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:09.770
Done.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:10.650
Tiny wins?

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:11.450
Tick.

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:12.730
Make it your colour.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:13.850
And this bit?

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:14.890
Grab a corner.

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:15.690
Peel it up.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:16.730
Take it with you.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:17.370
Click.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.170
Stuck.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.130
Resize it.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:19.770
Pin it.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.450
Alt N, and it's back.

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:22.330
No account.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:23.290
No cloud.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.650
Less mental clutter.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:25.770
Try Stickly.

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:27.210
Good ideas stick.
